      "reviewer": "OpenAI Codex",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-08-25T10:04:04Z",
      "note": "The first and only rfUSDT transaction in the Reaper attacker campaign is 0xb8d71893...2bbf at block 44052636 index 0. Its trace contains one direct call to redeem(uint256,address,address), naming receiver 0x2c177d20...a954 and owner 0xb573f01f...c864; the owner's allowance to caller 0x8162a5e1...0145 is zero at block 44052635. The receipt's Withdraw event records exactly 1002.055460 fUSDT; a later withdrawal to safe 0x539ef36c...88e0 is rescue activity. Creation transaction 0x90e2a8ec...a767 made the direct vault at block 42388401 index 1. Code is empty one block earlier, and the 16,821-byte runtime hash 0xd5cad149...c892e is identical at creation, a midpoint, and the pre-exploit block. EIP-1967 implementation, beacon and admin slots are zero, and the exploit trace has no DELEGATECALL from the vault. The code age is 2,043,946 seconds. Loss is the exact Withdraw asset total, valued at fUSDT par."
    }
